Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Did you know the sky above\Nus is like a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.65,0:00:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}invisible blanket with\Ndifferent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}layers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Each layer has its own\Nspecial job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Let's explore them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Right above where we stand\Nis the troposphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This is like our playground of\Nweather
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}clouds float like fluffy cotton\Ncandies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and rain falls to water the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's where planes zoom\Nthrough the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and birds fly about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s as close as a cozy\Nsweater keeping us warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Next up is the stratosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine this layer as the\Nprotector
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}we have the ozone layer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like a shield that blocks out\Nsome of the sun’s
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}strong rays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}just like sunscreen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s also home to the\Nfast-moving jet stream that\Nhelps planes fly quicker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Higher up is the mesosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}where the air is chilly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like the inside of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}freezer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s the place where\Nmeteors come zipping in and\Nburn up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}When you see a shooting star
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}it’s burning in this very\Nlayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Then comes the\Nthermosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}where it's hot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}yet feels cold because the air\Nis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}super thin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s a light show stage\Nwhere colorful auroras\Ndance in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like magical
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}lights
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It’s also where space\Nshuttles sometimes fly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Further and further up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}we find the exosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This layer feels like the outer\Ncourtyard of our earth-home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Satellites orbit here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}circling the earth like tiny\Nmoons
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}helping us talk to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}friends far away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Finally
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}beyond all these layers is\Nspace
